<title>USA: U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve announced average interest rates for the week ended Aug 1, compared with</p>
<p>the July 25 week, as follows:</p>
<p>    Federal funds rate.................5.57 vs 5.43</p>
<p>    3-month Treasury bills.............5.11 vs 5.08</p>
<p>    3-month commercial paper...........5.57 vs 5.55</p>
<p>    3-month bankers acceptances........5.51 vs 5.51</p>
<p>    3-month CDs........................5.58 vs 5.59</p>
<p>    3-month Eurodollar.................5.56 vs 5.59</p>
<p>    30-year Government bond............6.38 vs 6.46</p>
</text>
